From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Vunny Sodhi <vunny.sodhi@intel.com>
Date: Mon, 29 Jun 2026 00:00:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] media: ipu7: sync ACPI csi2 config with ep-aware isys ABI

The IPU7 "get source pad according to csi2 ep fwnode" change extends
struct ipu7_isys_csi2_config with a new fwnode endpoint pointer:

    struct fwnode_handle *ep;

However, the ACPI/platform-data side still defines and allocates the older
shorter ipu_isys_csi2_config without that field. When the patched IPU7
isys code reads csi2->ep on the ACPI path it reads beyond the end of the
allocated object and may pass garbage into
fwnode_graph_get_remote_endpoint(), leading to a rare fresh-boot OOPS.

Synchronize the ACPI-side struct definition with the IPU7-side layout so
the object size matches and ep is zero-initialized on the ACPI path.

Symptom:
- Rare fresh-boot OOPS in fwnode_graph_get_remote_endpoint()
- Non-canonical fwnode pointer observed in the crash log

Observed crash:
  Oops: general protection fault, probably for non-canonical address
        0x616c63752e75706b: 0000 [#1] SMP NOPTI
  CPU: 1 ... Tainted: G     U     OE       6.18.23-nonrt-000
  RIP: 0010:fwnode_graph_get_remote_endpoint+0x13/0x50
  RDI: 616c63752e757063
  Call Trace:
   ? isys_complete_ext_device_registration.isra.0+0x3f/0x260 [intel_ipu7_isys]
   isys_probe+0xa4a/0xda0 [intel_ipu7_isys]
   auxiliary_bus_probe+0x45/0x90
   really_probe+0xf1/0x3c0
   __driver_probe_device+0x8c/0x180
   driver_probe_device+0x24/0xd0
   __driver_attach+0x10b/0x210
   bus_add_driver+0x14e/0x290
   driver_register+0x5e/0x130
   __auxiliary_driver_register+0x73/0xf0

Root cause:
- ABI/layout mismatch between the IPU7 csi2 config struct and the ACPI
  csi2 config struct after adding the ep field

Solution:
- Add the missing ep field to the ACPI-side struct definition in
  include/media/ipu-acpi.h (the header consumed by the ipu-acpi-pdata
  module in this DKMS tree), with a fwnode_handle forward declaration

---
 include/media/ipu-acpi.h | 3 +++
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+)

diff --git a/include/media/ipu-acpi.h b/include/media/ipu-acpi.h
index a9b6687..6a9de61 100644
--- a/include/media/ipu-acpi.h
+++ b/include/media/ipu-acpi.h
@@ -27,10 +27,13 @@
 
 #include <media/v4l2-mediabus.h>
 
+struct fwnode_handle;
+
 struct ipu_isys_csi2_config {
 	unsigned int nlanes;
 	unsigned int port;
 	enum v4l2_mbus_type bus_type;
+	struct fwnode_handle *ep;
 };
 
 struct ipu_isys_subdev_i2c_info {
-- 
2.51.1
